 substations and supporting infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429930/extras/dd41977c91784ae024271b68e3c611e5.poster.avif?t=1751909017\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429930/extras/dd41977c91784ae024271b68e3c611e5.webm?t=1751909017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429930/extras/dd41977c91784ae024271b68e3c611e5.mp4?t=1751909017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overcome Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mother Nature can throw unexpected challenges your way, but as a resilient Power Network Tycoon, you're always prepared. Storms, heatwaves and other extreme weather events will put your skills to the test. Upgrade your infrastructure, strengthen power lines and use the weather forecasting systems to mitigate the impact of these natural disasters. Balancing resilience and costs is crucial as you work to keep the lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429930/extras/ec631c5b6faaefff13b422c670b7e870.poster.avif?t=1751909017\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429930/extras/ec631c5b6faaefff13b422c670b7e870.webm?t=1751909017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429930/extras/ec631c5b6faaefff13b422c670b7e870.mp4?t=1751909017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its immersive gameplay, realistic simulations, and multitude of challenges, you\u2019ll need creativity and strategic thinking to prove yourself as the ultimate Power Network Tycoon!</p>","developers":["David Made This"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429930/header.jpg?t=1751909017","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.00 LTS 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i7-8700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia\u00ae GeForce\u2122 GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.00 LTS 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core i5-12600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia\u00ae GeForce\u2122 GTX 3050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i7-10700K or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon\u2122 Pro 560 or better, NVIDIA GeForce GTX 775M or better, or any graphics card with 2 GB VRAM or more<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i7-10700K or Apple M1 Max<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon\u2122 Pro 5700 XT or bet